## About SKILL

- Introduction to SKILL
- Event objectives
- Program overview
- Event statistics

## Program SKILL

- SAINTEK (Science & Technology)
- SOSHUM (Social & Humanities)

## Featured Research Showcase

- Four selected research projects
- Research title
- Category
- Author information
- Featured exhibition preview

## Event Information

- Event date
- Time
- Venue

## Keynote Speakers

- Speaker profiles
- Institution
- Area of expertise

## Timeline

- Open Registration
- Close Registration
- Presentation Day

## Registration

- Registration information
- Requirements
- Registration button

## Gallery

- Documentation gallery
- Responsive bento layout

## History

- Previous SKILL events
- Documentation
- Themes
- Annual highlights

---

# Technology Stack

This website is built using:

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

No external frontend framework is used.

---

# Design Direction

The website adopts a modern event and exhibition style with emphasis on readability and visual hierarchy.

Design principles:

- Clean layout
- Responsive design
- Minimalist interface
- Smooth interaction
- Professional academic branding

